id: monica-official-toon-contracts
title: Adopt lossless official TOON and executable output contracts
description: "Replace the lossy handwritten TOON-like renderer with @toon-format/toon 4, validate real TOON by decoding it, close runtime/schema drift for unavailable API diagnostics, and update the repository-local PM/changelog toolchain."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[8]: agent-ux,api-contracts,formatting,lossless,output-schema,pm-governance,toon,typescript
created_at: "2026-07-24T20:59:00.157Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-24T21:41:23.352Z"
deadline: "2026-07-26T20:59:00.157Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-24T21:35:29.870Z"
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: "Default TOON output is emitted by @toon-format/toon 4 and decodes losslessly for nested records, arrays, long strings, nulls, and pagination envelopes; Every declared output schema accepts representative runtime payloads, and api-research probe schema includes supported, unsupported, unknown-id, unavailable, and error states with accurate counters; All command help, docs, schema examples, agent exports, and read-only E2E output validators reflect official TOON semantics; Repository PM dependencies and managed pm-changelog extension use the latest published versions without changing generated changelog by hand; Release gates pass with exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage, 100 percent export documentation, source files within 300 LOC, zero unjustified any/dynamic imports/duplication/security findings, and packed Bun/npm smoke proof; Live validation uses actual monica commands with read-only mode and proves mutations are blocked before network access; no private data is committed"
parent: monica-platform
reviewer: unbraind
risk: high
confidence: 94
sprint: 2026-07-output-contracts
release: next
reporter: codex-root
severity: high
environment: "Monica stable 4.x CLI, Bun 1.3.11, Node 22+, local read-only instance"
repro_steps: "Run formatToon on a value containing a string longer than 60 characters or an array of nested objects, then attempt official TOON decode; inspect api-research-probe schema status enum against the runtime unavailable state."
resolution: "Replaced the custom lossy serializer with the official TOON v4 codec, added strict decoding to E2E and schema-validation paths, reconciled probe runtime/schema states and optional fields, upgraded PM/changelog tooling, patched GHSA-pm4m-ph32-ghv5, and updated the complete affected documentation/test surface."
expected_result: "Default TOON is official, lossless, schema-valid, independently decodable, and safe for agent automation across the mapped Monica 4.x surface."
actual_result: Official @toon-format/toon 4.0.0 now emits lossless default output and complete pagination envelopes; schema validation accepts TOON files/stdin; unavailable probe payloads validate; PM and changelog tooling are current; release gates and read-only acceptance are green.
affected_version: 2026.7.23
fixed_version: 2026.7.24
component: output-contracts
regression: false
customer_impact: Agents can receive incomplete CRM records or reject truthful unavailable diagnostics despite nominal schema support.
