comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T20:59:00.157Z",codex-root,"Research baseline: Monica 4.x remains pinned at commit 32028ce with 35 resources and 172 already mapped endpoints. The local instance remains unavailable at server bootstrap, so no route incompatibility item is warranted."
  "2026-07-24T20:59:04.352Z",codex-root,"Implementation decision: use the package-owned encode/decode APIs after inspecting @toon-format/toon 4.0.0 declarations; retain field filtering before encoding so all output modes share the same selected payload."
  "2026-07-24T21:05:11.082Z",codex-root,"Implementation milestone: official TOON 4.0.0 now round-trips selected payloads and full pagination envelopes; schemas validate accepts .toon and explicit TOON stdin; the api-research unavailable runtime payload validates against its registered schema. Repository dev tooling is @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.7.24-3 and PM-managed pm-changelog 2026.7.23."
  "2026-07-24T21:22:04.045Z",codex-root,"Security gate finding: GHSA-pm4m-ph32-ghv5 newly marked js-yaml 5.0.0 through 5.2.1 high severity. The existing root override is raised to first fixed 5.2.2; bun audit now reports zero vulnerabilities. This is dependency drift, not a pm-cli/SDK defect, so no upstream pm-cli issue is appropriate."
  "2026-07-24T21:35:28.773Z",codex-root,"Final acceptance: 846 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; 579/579 documented exports; 273/273 help leaves; 95 live read-only checks with 42 pass, 53 expected unavailable, zero fail, and five writes blocked; Node/npm and Bun packed smoke passed at 2026.7.24; bun audit and tracked-secret audits report zero findings; PM validation/health/dedupe are clean."
  "2026-07-24T21:37:59.227Z",codex-root,"Post-close self-review tightened the public command contract: schemas validate help now names JSON/TOON/YAML and --input-format normalizes valid values while rejecting unsupported formats before input is read. Focused tests, typecheck, lint, and 580/580 documentation coverage pass."
  "2026-07-24T21:41:23.351Z",codex-root,"Exact final verify:release passed after schema-input parser hardening with 847 tests, exact 100/100/100/100, 580/580 documented exports, 273/273 help commands, npx/bunx packed version 2026.7.24, zero bun-audit vulnerabilities, and clean history/version audits."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T20:59:00.157Z",codex-root,"Privacy decision: do not record credentials, contact identifiers, response bodies, or signed URLs. ~/.monica-cli/settings.json remains mode 0600 with defaultFormat=toon and readOnlyMode=true."
  "2026-07-24T21:35:27.019Z",codex-root,"Live acceptance remained read-only. The configured instance still fails before authentication while loading Cloudflare trust proxies; route mapping remains 35 of 35 resources and 172 endpoints, and the failure is correctly represented as unavailable rather than unsupported."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T20:59:00.157Z",codex-root,"Endpoint parity is insufficient when the default serialization can discard values; agent-safe parity requires a lossless, independently decodable output contract."
  "2026-07-24T21:35:27.814Z",codex-root,"A format is not agent-safe merely because it is concise: the codec must be official, round-trippable, lossless for JSON-compatible values, and validated at the real stdout boundary."
