close_reason: "Official lossless TOON and executable schema contracts are production-ready with exact quality, package, security, PM, and read-only live evidence."
body: "## Context\nThe stable Monica 4.x route inventory is still complete, but the default formatter is not the official TOON implementation: it truncates strings, collapses nested object arrays, and cannot round-trip structured output. The live read-only instance also exposes an unavailable diagnostic state that is absent from the declared api-research probe schema.\n\n## Delivery\n- Adopt the official @toon-format/toon 4 codec using its shipped TypeScript types.\n- Preserve field selection and pagination while making structured TOON lossless and decodable.\n- Validate TOON output with the official decoder in unit and real-CLI acceptance paths.\n- Reconcile API research runtime payloads and published schemas, including unavailable infrastructure states.\n- Upgrade @unbrained/pm-cli and pm-changelog to current published versions and regenerate only through pm-changelog.\n- Update all affected docs, help/examples, agent contracts, and release evidence.\n\n## Safety\nAll local Monica validation remains GET-only with readOnlyMode enabled. Credentials and live payloads stay under ~/.monica-cli and must not enter tracker data, Git, logs, or PR text."
